# The toolchain, pinned in one place.
#
# Every other place that names a version reads it from here: the CI
# workflows parse this file to install the toolchain, and the check task
# (`mix veritas.toolchain`) asserts that what is running is what this file
# says.
#
# Elixir is pinned exactly. Erlang is pinned to its release line: the
# security fixes land on the newest patch of the line, so a patch-pinned
# Erlang would age out of the security window the moment a new patch ships.
# The CI log records the exact patch that was installed.
elixir 1.20.4
erlang 29
